{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26925","headline":"杭州官舍偶书 · 姚合","name":"杭州官舍偶书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钱塘刺史谩题诗，贫褊无恩懦少威。\n春尽酒杯花影在，潮回画槛水声微。\n闲吟山际邀僧上，暮入林中看鹤归。\n无术理人人自理，朝朝渐觉簿书稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}